[FINAL-TEXT] I now have complete evidence. Let me compile the full picture:

- **r12 and r13** run **EIGRP AS 100** (not OSPF) — by design; r11 is the ASBR that redistributes EIGRP into OSPF (explaining the 11 external LSAs everywhere).
